# The mt2009 engine source, its Extern tree and the runtime files are staged
# here from the package (Downloads\Metin2 Singleplayer) and never committed --
# the same rule as linux-port/docker/game/src. What the repository holds is
# the port itself: port/, the Dockerfiles, the container scripts.
docker/game/src/server/
docker/game/src/extern/
docker/game/src/extern-tarballs/
docker/game/src/serverfiles/
# The SQL dumps come out of the package too (sql\*.sql) and are not ours to
# redistribute; the installer stages them, the same as linux-port's.
docker/mariadb/initdb.d/dumps/
